{"id":"187c4495154fb991","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-coalitionstrength.md","title":"Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity","display":"df-coalitionstrength — Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-coalitionstrength","aliases":["27-df-coalitionstrength"],"display":"df-coalitionstrength — Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolop]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§8.8 Definitions 8.8–8.9","source_statement":"Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity","source_printed_pages":"391–392","source_pdf_pages":"415–416","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-coalitionstrength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-coalitionstrength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coalitionstrength — Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11de8465f2282555\" href=\"?note=11de8465f2282555\" title=\"27-df-boolop\">27-df-boolop</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.8 Definitions 8.8–8.9"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"187c4495154fb991\" href=\"?note=187c4495154fb991\" title=\"Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity\">Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"391–392"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"415–416"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq N\">\\(S,T\\subseteq N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S\">\\(\\chi_S\\)</span> 为S的特征向量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee\">\\(\\vee\\)</span> 表示逐坐标最大值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in S\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in N\\setminus S\\}\\quad(S\\subseteq N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_S\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in S\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in N\\setminus S\\}\\quad(S\\subseteq N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall i\\in S\\cup T\\;(x_i=0)\\right)\\Rightarrow f(x\\vee\\chi_S)\\geq f(x\\vee\\chi_T)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall i\\in S\\cup T\\;(x_i=0)\\right)\\Rightarrow f(x\\vee\\chi_S)\\geq f(x\\vee\\chi_T)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\quad\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\forall S,T\\subseteq N\\;\\left(|S\\cup T|\\leq k\\Rightarrow(S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\lor T\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}S)\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\quad\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\forall S,T\\subseteq N\\;\\left(|S\\cup T|\\leq k\\Rightarrow(S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\lor T\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}S)\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\forall S,T\\subseteq N\\;(S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\lor T\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}S)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\forall S,T\\subseteq N\\;(S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\lor T\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}S)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一般集合强度并未在此声称是传递预序；参数 S、T 可以重叠。k阶单调允许负变量的一致方向，因此 k=1 对应 unate 的一般单调性，不能误写成只含正函数的 Monotone_n。n=0时 CompleteMono 仍有直接真空定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolop","status":"resolved","id":"11de8465f2282555","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolop]]","embed":false},{"target":"Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"187c4495154fb991","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_S\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in S\\}\\cup\\{(i,0)\\mid i\\in N\\setminus S\\}\\quad(S\\subseteq N).","display":true},{"tex":"S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left(\\forall i\\in S\\cup T\\;(x_i=0)\\right)\\Rightarrow f(x\\vee\\chi_S)\\geq f(x\\vee\\chi_T)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\quad\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\forall S,T\\subseteq N\\;\\left(|S\\cup T|\\leq k\\Rightarrow(S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\lor T\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}S)\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}:\\forall S,T\\subseteq N\\;(S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T\\lor T\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}S)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2033,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-coalitionstrength|df-coalitionstrength — Coalition strength and the hierarchy of k-monotonicity]]"},{"id":"57a61e79463767d7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$；见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$S,T\\subseteq[n]$，$\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}$、$\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n$、$\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-coalitionstrength]]。"}],"outgoing":["11de8465f2282555"]}